    "test-results/list-native-baseline-blink/"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Writer list sidebar is bounded to ordinary body lists; complex shared templates, linked parent numbering, outline headings, picture bullets and mixed lists are refused.",
    "No continue-previous-list action. New-rule owners cap at 512; save/reopen resets resources. Vetoed native-close retention is statically checked, not end-to-end exercised.",
    "No completed controlled reproduction proves the exact garbage-collection causal timing of the old redo failure.",
    "Calc formatting checks at most 10,000 cells and writes character attributes to at most 256 rich cells. Noncontiguous-selection protection has contract tests, not a mouse multi-select end-to-end capture.",
    "Conditional-format final appearance and complete style inheritance are not exhaustively merged by the toolbar.",
    "Native menus remain embedded. The earlier narrow screenshots captured transient resize frames; persistent distortion was not confirmed. Stable viewport follow-up supersedes that interpretation. Complete mobile support is not established.",
    "Original native numbering samples show filter-specific continuation; exported reference opening proves readability and recorded rendering only.",
    "Unedited and edited ODT both show cross-style continuation numbering differently in the reference desktop. Original continue-list chains and list definitions are preserved; this existing interoperability difference remains unresolved.",
    "Known engine formula/type differences, full animations, SmartArt structural editing, advanced layout, OCR and certificate signing remain incomplete; no arbitrary-document lossless guarantee."
  ],
